    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Since class 0 is negative and class 1 is positive, the entries are ordered as\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\begin{pmatrix}\n",
        "TN & FP\\\\\n",
        "FN & TP\n",
        "\\end{pmatrix}.\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "We can extract the four entries and compute common metrics."
      ],
